The elf seemed harder to me than I expected. Note though, that none
of the games that I lost were due to not having magic resistance.
Most of them were to relatively low-level monsters, and generally
because I was not being careful enough. I have a bad habit of
losing the prudence that I start the games with when I get to about
experience level 9 or 10. By that time I can easily kill the
weak monsters and don't pay enough attention to my hit points and
get done in by a medium or even weak monster because I stood my
ground and attacked when I should have retreated. So, I don't
think that the elf should really have required 20 tries. If I
had been careful, I think I could have gotten lucky enough in
half that number.



